note as MIGRATION_diagram_17b_financial_planning
  billing.insurance_claims is retained only as a compatibility/financial posting
  bridge. New eligibility, prior authorization, claim and adjudication workflows
  use insurance.*. No dual source of truth is permitted.
end note

note as VIEWS_diagram_17b_financial_planning
  financial_kpi_snapshots and receivables_aging_view are read projections. Their
  definitions, owners, refresh cadence and source dependencies are registered in
  the portal/read-model catalogue.
end note

note as CLAIM_OWNERSHIP
  CLAIM OWNERSHIP
  insurance.insurance_claims and insurance.insurance_claim_lines in Module 26 are
  canonical. Billing references claim IDs for invoices and reimbursements but does
  not own a second claim aggregate or a competing claim lifecycle.
end note


