note as BILLING_CLEARING_MODEL
  Payments are no longer constrained to one invoice/bill. Allocation tables support
  partial, combined and residual clearing while accounting.open_items remains the
  canonical subledger balance. Bills and invoice lines connect explicitly to contract,
  order and receipt/service evidence for end-to-end document flow and three-way match.
end note

